import QtQuick.tooling 1.2

// Qt5Compat.GraphicalEffects types the shell renders natively. Upstream they are QML files
// whose root is an Item (e.g. DropShadow.qml), so they carry no qmltypes: these entries give
// them the QQuickItem chain and the properties those files declare. Their defaults live in the
// QML files, which the renderer applies.

